I'm not sure if I understand what you try to do.
If you assume that SGI code is binary compatible to DEC alpha code,
this assumption is the source of your problem. They are *not*.
If you change to another platform with different processors
(e.g. Sun Ultra, HP PA), programs are not binary compatible. You
need to compile them again (which already introduces some headaches).

Even same processors (actually processors of the same vendor) using
differens OS-versions introduce several problems.

Hope that helps,

