Newsgroups: comp.unix.osf.osf1


DIGITAL UNIX V4.0C is a hardware release of DIGITAL UNIX. What that
means is that it is DIGITAL UNIX V4.0B with necessary changes
to support the new hardware. In this case the Personal Workstation
433au and the like.

The installation process knows, based on the processor type,
whether or not to load the new bits. As a result, if you
install this product on a machine that is not a Personal Workstation
you end up with V4.0B.

