To minimize UBC try using:
ubc-maxpercent 
ubc-borrowpercent
vm-ubcseqstartpercent

These are explained in the kernel tuning doc. There are some other
parameters to do with ubc usages as well. With these you can limit the
max size of the UBC and also the maximum amount of the UBC used for
buffering a single file.

Nick Hill



