Hi

For some strange reason our quota,edquota etc. don't show anything.
Instead I use vquota, vedquota...
Anyway here's how I did it. (If it is of any use to you)

- First vedquota xxx as a proto-user
- Then cd to the directory where all our users' home-directories are.
  Just tried vedquota -pxxx -u * (our usernames and home-directory names
  are the same) and it really copied the proto quotas to the usernames.

